# Secrets for servers/garmin: one ENV_VAR and how to set it per line. Each is stored
# in Secret Manager as garmin-mcp-<env-var-in-kebab-case>, e.g. garmin-mcp-allowed-emails.
#   ask / ask-hidden  you type it in (hidden: not echoed)
#   random            openssl rand -base64 48
#   fernet            a Fernet key (32 random bytes, urlsafe base64)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID        ask
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET    ask-hidden
ALLOWED_EMAILS          ask
JWT_SIGNING_KEY         random
SESSION_SECRET          random
STORAGE_ENCRYPTION_KEY  fernet
